AbMPNN model weights
====================

Attribution required by the licence under which these weights are distributed.

Work      Inverse folding for antibody sequence design using deep learning
          (model weights of the AbMPNN model, presented at the 2023 ICML
          Workshop on Computational Biology; the paper is arXiv:2310.19513)
Authors   Frederic A. Dreyer, Daniel Cutting, Constantin Schneider,
          Henry Kenlay, Charlotte M. Deane
Source    Zenodo, published 2023-07-19
