Changes made
------------
The file distributed here is

    colabdesign/colabdesign/mpnn/weights_abmpnn/abmpnn.pkl

which is a format conversion of the published checkpoint. The published file is
`abmpnn.pt` (PyTorch, md5 911df5d74f2955373286c3bb3df69409, 20.0 MB); the copy
here holds the same parameters in the JAX/pickle layout that ColabDesign loads,
produced by the conversion notebook shipped alongside it at
`colabdesign/mpnn/convert_weights/convert.ipynb`. CC BY 4.0 requires that
changes be indicated, and a format conversion is a change, so it is stated here
rather than left to be inferred from the file extension.

How these weights reached this repository
-----------------------------------------
Upstream ColabDesign (https://github.com/sokrypton/ColabDesign) ships
`colabdesign/mpnn/weights` and `colabdesign/mpnn/weights_soluble`, whose git
tree hashes are identical to the copies here (68abaf5a… and f9f9194d…), and
those hold the ProteinMPNN weights. It does **not** ship a `weights_abmpnn`
directory. That directory was added in the Germinal fork of ColabDesign, from
which this tree descends, and it arrives here with it. ColabDesign's own licence
(`colabdesign/LICENSE.txt`, Beer-Ware revision 42) covers ColabDesign's content
and so does not extend to a file placed into that tree by someone else, which is
why this notice exists separately.

AbMPNN is a fine-tune of ProteinMPNN (https://github.com/dauparas/ProteinMPNN);
the ProteinMPNN weights in the two sibling directories are covered by that
project's own terms and are unmodified here.
